sters sends logs out of Azure: the tools pull from Event Hubs, and runner pods have no route to them." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#BDBDBD;dashed=1;dashPattern=3 3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#1F1F1F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="800" width="1360" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>